    {
      "id": "c8b98118c4b56666",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 2420,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 跨公司关系索引\n\n**P01** · TSMC → Apple\nApple silicon 先进制程代工\n\n**P02** · TSMC → NVIDIA\nAI 芯片先进制程代工与封装\n\n**P03** · SK Hynix → NVIDIA\nAI 加速器用 HBM\n\n**P04** · Samsung Electronics → NVIDIA\nHBM/DRAM 供应基线\n\n**P05** · NVIDIA → Amazon / AWS\nAWS 上的 GPU 与 AI 基础设施\n\n**P06** · NVIDIA → Microsoft\nAzure AI 加速器生态\n\n**P08** · Samsung Electronics → Apple\n存储/显示组件基线\n\n**P09** · NVIDIA → Tesla\n汽车/AI 计算生态基线",
      "color": "#334155"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
